# A planted ledger: each runtime symbol of the planted configuration, and the count of the throw helper.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | helper-throw | 1 | _ZSt24__throw_out_of_range_fmtPKcz | -
@build/libcrucible.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZSt24__throw_out_of_range_fmtPKcz | -
